      "example_text": "Input: a = 1, b = 2, c = 5\nOutput: [1,2]\nExplanation: Move the stone from 5 to 3, or move the stone from 5 to 4 to 3.",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "example_num": 2,
      "example_text": "Input: a = 4, b = 3, c = 2\nOutput: [0,0]\nExplanation: We cannot make any moves.",
